    "summary.md": "# Pantry Keeper\n\nTrack pantry items, quantities, and expiry dates to quickly see what's running low or expiring soon.\n\n- **Target user:** Home cooks who want to avoid buying duplicates\n- **Build route:** compile\n- **Genome:** tracker\n- **Persistence:** browser-local storage\n- **Start:** `npm run dev` → http://localhost:3000\n\n## Planned verification journeys\n\n- Application loads and shows a useful empty state\n- Invalid item input shows validation without crashing\n- User can add a complete item and see it in items\n- items survive a page refresh\n- User can edit an existing item\n- User can search items\n- User can narrow items with a meaningful filter\n- items are grouped by a meaningful category or status\n- Requested derived values update from persisted records\n- User can delete an existing item\n"
  },
